{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Benjumpin Hopkins</strong>\u00a0is a challenging\u00a0(it's harder then it looks)\u00a0but easy to learn physics based\u00a0precision platformer about Benji The Frog, who has a dream to jump as high as anyone can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of Benji The Frog who likes to jump, has a goal to climb up to the top of this infamous well. His adventure to reach the top will demand all mastery of jumping technique. He is always in good mood and never gives up. Would you give up on this challenge? There might be a princess waiting at the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet <strong>Benji</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141550/extras/9c1c102515205b76a3a5b0c81bcb8548.poster.avif?t=1762862360\" width=1024 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141550/extras/9c1c102515205b76a3a5b0c81bcb8548.webm?t=1762862360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Experience platforming at its most intense!</strong>  <br>There\u2019s only one direction to go - up. But the greatest battle is against your own mistakes. Each jump tightens the pressure, as a single slip can send you tumbling back down\u2026 and it\u2019s up to you to climb again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Hold to charge, release to launch!</strong>  <br>Jumping may sound simple, but true mastery takes patience, timing, and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Plan every move carefully!</strong>  <br>The easiest route isn\u2019t always the smartest, and once you\u2019re midair, there\u2019s no way to change course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult but satisfying gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel every jump with your body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher the climb, the harder the fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every success and setback is automatically saved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your trumpet. Because its fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect tasty flies and new outfits</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141550/extras/9bd94b02499ede508dbef6b940bc6702.poster.avif?t=1762862360\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141550/extras/9bd94b02499ede508dbef6b940bc6702.webm?t=1762862360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141550/extras/9bd94b02499ede508dbef6b940bc6702.mp4?t=1762862360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game keeps humorous and light tone and magical atmosphere. Meet cozy characters, fellow wellpinists on your journey through this magical well world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic 3D cartoony graphics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snappy animations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer offers 2 modes. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coop climbing to fail with your friends together. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing to challenge your friends in fast jumping techniques.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo contains 4 areas of Singleplayer level and 2 multiplayer maps. The Demo on average is about 2 hour long depending from player's skill.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Winner!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4141550/0e367838317a71250aa1ceda566800f441e70ddd.jpg"},{"name":"King of flies.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4141550/a9df0157f8a15e80a250f275932b61f4f306473c.jpg"},{"name":"10 Flies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4141550/bf55ecc2ae6d27944f68495b0bed03abca1b16cc.jpg"},{"name":"25 flies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4141550/9a0aea25813169278bee0b2da6ba9cf5ebab9587.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4141550?t=1762862360","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4141550?t=1762862360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141550/9f1e1d2e31d2c96ce9fae4b9d9194bb5e9ae976a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762862360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141550/9f1e1d2e31d2c96ce9fae4b9d9194bb5e9ae976a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762862360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15