?t=1762862360"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141550/292e7e51039edf1c85583c17a87e8d433acbb444/ss_292e7e51039edf1c85583c17a87e8d433acbb444.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762862360","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141550/292e7e51039edf1c85583c17a87e8d433acbb444/ss_292e7e51039edf1c85583c17a87e8d433acbb444.600x338.jpg?t=1762862360"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141550/b2af596f8309a5bcd0d37ae777020a33665b6cd9/ss_b2af596f8309a5bcd0d37ae777020a33665b6cd9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762862360","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141550/b2af596f8309a5bcd0d37ae777020a33665b6cd9/ss_b2af596f8309a5bcd0d37ae777020a33665b6cd9.600x338.jpg?t=1762862360"}],"short_description":"A challenging high-stakes physics based\u00a0precision platformer. You take a role of Benji The Frog, who likes to jump, has a goal to climb up to the top of this infamous magical well, where a princess might be waiting. A single missed jump can lead to a long fall back down, but Benji never gives up.","steam_appid":4141550,"support_info":{"email":"benjumpin.hopkins.support@proton.me","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"demo","website":null}